<img src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c85af1_3eaf38321b754e1a9a9165e162bce752~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_485,h_455,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_auto/day%203.png">

<br>
Things are really moving along now. You’ve found yourself quite well settled into the role of Librarian. You wonder who’ll be along today. 

''Alastor'' seemed quite distracted the last time you saw him, possibly even conflicted.

''Bruce'' ran into Evelyn, his daughter, and they argued a little bit and talked about her art.

''Cora'' was looking for some new stylistic inspiration for a game she’s in charge of visuals for. She also mentioned a new hire.

''Darien'' has been assigned to a new project at work.

''Florian'' now has all the details nailed down for his final uni project.

(link-goto: "Return", $lastPassage)


:: Daily Note 7 [menu] {"position":"1500,500","size":"100,100"}
<style> img {
