<br>
Wow, seems like ages since you’ve first started. You think back proudly at your long list of recommendations, even the bad ones. ;)

There’s no reason to think that tomorrow won’t be precisely the same as today, but you can’t shake the feeling that today is your final day as librarian.

''Alastor'' was extremely conflicted, and is likely off doing something nefarious.

''Bruce'' ran into Evelyn, and they argued a little bit and talked about her art.

''Cora''  bumped into Darien, and it turns out they’re co-workers

''Florian'' now has everything he needs for his final uni project.

(link-goto: "Return", $lastPassage)


