:: FlorianEnct3 {"position":"300,3200","size":"100,100"}
//The morning is passing pleasantly when you notice a figure coming towards you. You can’t help but cheer up a little as you recognize the slightly distracted but infectious smile of Florian.//

“Hey, what’s up? It’s me again, back for another book. I’ve changed my mind about my final uni project, I want to do it about a specific artist in a style other than their own. Last time I got a book about an artist, now I’m looking for one about a style.”

[[“Ooh that sounds really cool, I’m sure your final project will go wonderfully! You’ll have to show me when you’re all done.”]]

[[“Changing up your project? You might want to nail down the focus of it before it gets away from you.”]]


:: FlorianGoodRec {"position":"4500,4000","size":"100,100"}
“Pretty well I’d say, a bit of room for improvement, but that’s always the case for creatives, isn’t it. The tutors thought I had great potential, and that I might grown into quite the artist someday. Thanks for the book recommendations, they really ended up inspiring the best parts of the project.”

“Hey that’s great to hear man, I’m really happy for you. And I couldn’t possibly take credit for any of your success, that was all you.”

[[“While you’re here, can I also offer you a book, for old times sake maybe?”]]


