[[“While you’re here, can I also offer you a book, for old times sake maybe?”]]


:: Give Cora's advice {"position":"4600,2900","size":"100,100"}
“Well it just so happened I was talking to some visitor in management the other day, and she had some advice. She wished people would be happier to share even their dumb ideas, without worrying too much about criticism. Maybe there’s something in that.”

“That’s... Thanks actually, I’ll have to think about that.”

[[“In the meantime, do you want a book?”]]

