:: Great! What do I do? {"position":"1650,1250","size":"100,100"}
A library's role is to enrich the lives of it's visitors. Knowledge is power and art fills the soul. 

So amidst your normal maintenance of the library's collection, your primary role as head librarian will be to ensure that you help out your visitors to the best of your visitors.

Look! Here comes your first victi- visitor!

[[Look at the visitor]]
