:: “I’m glad to hear it’s sparked your imagination. Do you still think art all arbitrary and useless?” {"position":"6300,2100","size":"100,100"}
“Well obviously paint on pieces of paper isn’t useful for anything itself. At most they’re talking pieces, and yet worth absurd amounts. Which lead me to think, perhaps there’s more to it. Perhaps the value is in the ideas, and the art is merely the medium of expression.”

“That’s right. Or perhaps that’s right for you. The beauty in art is the questions it poses, at least to me anyways. I’m glad you’re starting to find your own meaning. It’s getting a little late, what can I help you find today?”

[[Continue|AlastorContd2]]

(set: $alastorFavour to it + 1)
