“A ghost? Heh, something like that. I’m sure I’m just paranoid in my retirement. At least that’s what my daughter always tells me.”

[[“Your daughter? Did she not approve of your job as a detective?”]]


:: “Well I’m glad to see you two getting on, I guess the power of art really can be transformative.” {"position":"6500,3000","size":"100,100"}
“Ugh that sounds a bit cheesy, even if it is your job. But thank you for your role in this, I’m sure he didn’t figure it out himself. Goodbye.”

[["Goodbye, and all the best."|Day 5 end]]


:: “Well, every person can find their own meaning in it. But I think that art can be meaningful as a means of expressing ideas in a fundamentally human way.” {"position":"6300,2500","size":"100,100"}
“That’s an intriguing thought. Perhaps... I’ll need to think more on this later. Regardless, I am here for a  book.”

[[Continue|AlastorContd2]]


:: “Well, this my job after all. I’m happy to help.” {"position":"3100,4000","size":"100,100"}
“Is that the only reason you do this, because it’s your job?”

[[“No, I do this because I enjoy it. And because I find meaning in art. I’ve seen the power art has to positively shape peoples’ lives.”]]

[[“Yeah, It’s just a job. Some visitors make it enjoyable, but some... don’t.”|AlastorBadContd1]]


:: “What kind of visual style are you looking for?” {"position":"3300,3200","size":"100,100"}
“Hmm, something geometric, we need a defining motif or art style for our game, something will stand out uniquely, ideally with some repeating form or motif.”

“Ooh, I think I’ve got just the thing for you.”

[[Check Library|Library Collection]]

[[Recommend Cubism|CoraGoodRec2]]

[[Recommend Minimalism|CoraBadRec2]]

[[Recommend Abstract art|CoraBadRec2]]

