:: “While you’re here, can I also offer you a book, for old times sake maybe?” {"position":"4700,4000","size":"100,100"}
“Ah thanks but no thanks. Today I’m just here to chat and return this. It was pretty intense grinding out that final project, I think I’m going to take a break and let the creative juices recharge. Thanks again for your help, and goodbye.”

[[“Goodbye.”|BruceEnct7]]


:: “Yeah, here you go.” {"position":"6800,3800","size":"100,100"}
“Thank you. You’ve proven to be quite the asset after all.”

[[Continue|BruceContd10]]

(set: $bruceNote to false)



:: “Yeah, what a coincidence. Can I give you a book before you leave?” {"position":"1500,4000","size":"100,100"}
“Sure, can I just get the same book as Cora?”

“Of course, here you go.”

[[Hand Darien a copy of the same book as Cora.]]


:: “You look troubled, can I offer you a nice book for these trying times?” {"position":"2200,3200","size":"100,100"}
“Troubled? Hah. You’ve given me a lot to think about, with your books and your ideas. But... certain things have been set in motion. Nevertheless I have time to grab a book before I depart. I would appreciate learning about an art style that portrays life from a very different perspective.”

[[Check Library|Library Collection]]

[[Recommend Constructivism|AlastorContd5]]

[[Recommend Romanticism|AlastorContd5]]

[[Recommend Modernism|AlastorContd5]]

