:: “You two know each other?” {"position":"1300,4000","size":"100,100"}
“Yes, we’re co-workers.” Cora replies.

“Cora is my manager at my new job, actually what a coincidence to bump into each other here.”

[[“Yeah, what a coincidence. Can I give you a book before you leave?”]]


:: “Your daughter? Did she not approve of your job as a detective?” {"position":"4500,2200","size":"100,100"}
“I was a Private Investigator, not a detective, but no she didn’t like it. Then again, I never really saw much point in her paintings, either. But that’s why I’m here now, to see if there is something in it.”

[[“How did you like that last book?”]] 


:: “You’re welcome. Goodbye.” {"position":"3700,3200","size":"100,100"}
//And as she leaves the building, your fourth day comes to an end. //

